# mm.configure

Parses GCC and Clang compiler selectors and debug or release builds, then
atomically persists the one project-wide configuration consumed by both build
and test.

Resolves typed manifest options, resets, and read-only locks from a neutral parent-indexed tree and writes resolved-options.mdy snapshots beneath out. Supplies the shared typed build-default policy; neither this resolver nor the record writer invokes a compiler.
